      <title>98%企业高估AI成熟度，窗口期仅剩3-4年</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260903/98%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E9%AB%98%E4%BC%B0AI%E6%88%90%E7%86%9F%E5%BA%A6%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%85%E5%89%A93-4%E5%B9%B4/</link>
